Good morning,

This property lies on an unmaintained right-of-way (pink dots in below imag=
e). In order to obtain a building permit, the property owner would need to =
extend the water/sewer main and build a road to this property. Do note that=
 extending the water/sewer mains and road would be a private endeavor and a=
ll costs would be out-of-pocket to the property owner. You will need to con=
sult with a private licensed civil engineer for cost estimates and timefram=
es.

Sewer (green line) is available through the easement that runs on the prope=
rty, but the property owner will need to figure out the water and street si=
tuation first.

For questions regarding development, please reach out to planning@durhamnc.=
gov.


