Hello,
I'm doing due diligence on a possible purchase. Durham Planning referred me=
 to you for the questions below. A quick reply, even partial, would help me=
 a lot.

1. Are public water and sewer available at 1621 Clermont, or would I have t=
o extend mains and roughly how far?
2. Does Clermont Rd provide enough frontage to develop/subdivide 1621?
3. Is Clermont Rd city-maintained up to the parcel, or private/undeveloped?=
 Would I need to build out the road?
4. Any capacity or easement constraints I should know before designing?

Thanks,
Kalin Ivanov

